            <tr><td>Geographic Location Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;Provides the information of a geographic region of the entity (customer, equipment, address).&lt;/p&gt;</td><td>TMF675</td><td>Common</td><td>RESTful</td><td>N/A</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Customer Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;Provides a standardized mechanism for customer and customer account management, such as creation, update, retrieval, deletion and notification of events. 
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version history&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;v5.0.0 &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; 08-May-2026 docker-compose has been expanded to enable proxy settings by default, simplifying CTK execution in corporate HTTP proxy environments where this previously required in‑house configuration. README files have been updated to document proxy usage. Failed HTML reports can now be opened directly in a browser, and HTML reports now include headers identifying the API and CTK version used, improving certification clarity and traceability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;21-Jan-2026 The CTK and RI have been re-released in a dockerized format, this may require different set up requirements and any automation platforms will need to be updated. Click &lt;a href="https://projects.tmforum.org/wiki/display/API/TM+Forum+Open+API+Conformance+Testing+and+Validation+Instructions+Page" 
     target="_blank" 
     rel="noopener noreferrer" 
     class="styled-link"&gt;
    here for more information&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;25 Jul 2024 Open API Specification (OAS) v5.0.1 release fixes bug  v5.0.0 OAS file TMF629 Customer Management is missing Characteristic subclasses.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;br&gt; v4.0.0 &lt;/br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
15-May-2026 –  CTK updated
docker-compose has been expanded to enable proxy settings by default, simplifying CTK execution in corporate HTTP proxy environments. README files have been updated to document proxy configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;07-Nov-2024 TMF629 v4.0.0 CTK file fix Mac-Linux-RUNCTK.sh modified to remove syntax errors. No impact to awarded Open API Conformance certifications.

