&lt;/style&gt;</td><td>TMF629</td><td>Customer</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v5.0</td><td>2026-05-08</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Cost Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;The Cost Management API provides a standardized mechanism to manage projected and actual costs across telecom services and resources. It enables creating, updating, deleting, and retrieving cost instances, each containing one or more cost items. The API supports three cost cycles: one-time costs, recurring fixed costs, and consumption-based costs. It is designed to interact seamlessly with various ODA function blocks for effective cost tracking and optimization. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version history&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;v5.0.0
&lt;p&gt; 18 July 2025 TMF764 preview release v5.0.0: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile
&lt;/p&gt;</td><td>TMF764</td><td>Common</td><td>RESTful</td><td>N/A</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Document Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;Provides the operations to synchronize documents and document versions across systems. It also provides operations for uploading documents by Users as well as for viewing of documents online&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version history&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt; v5.0.0&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
05-Aug-2026 – TMF667 v5.0.0 Stable release including the Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, Postman Collection, Sample Implementation Code, and Conformance Test Kit (CTK).
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
15-July-2026 – TMF667 v5.0.0 RC2 Preview release: Updated preview with minor changes including addition of use cases to user guide, improved examples and descriptions, and an updated/clarified conformance profile. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
04-Jun-2026 – TMF667 v5.0.0 RC1 Preview release: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, and Postman Collection. 
This release provides an updated v5.0.0 preview of the Document Management API, aligned with the latest TM Forum Open API standards and includes a Postman Collection.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;14-Oct-2024  TMF667 v5.0.0 preview release: Open API Specification, User Guide and Conformance profile  &lt;/p&gt;
