docker-compose has been expanded to enable proxy settings by default, simplifying CTK execution in corporate HTTP proxy environments. README files have been updated to document proxy configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
07-Nov-2024  TMF667 v4.0.0 CTK file fix Mac-Linux-RUNCTK.sh modified to remove syntax errors. No impact to awarded Open API Conformance certifications.</td><td>TMF667</td><td>Common</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v5.0</td><td>2026-08-05</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Service Catalog Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;The Service Catalog Management API allows the management of the entire lifecycle of the service catalog elements.&lt;/p&gt;
