14-Oct-2024 TMF685 v5.0.0  preview release: Open API Specification, User Guide and Conformance profile </td><td>TMF685</td><td>Resource</td><td>RESTful</td><td>N/A</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Fraud Managment API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;The Fraud Management API provides a standardized mechanism for evaluating fraud risk associated with a telecommunications customer or transaction. The API enables requesting parties (such as merchants, banks, or internal systems) to submit fraud evaluation requests and receive comprehensive risk assessments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version history&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;v5.0.0
