&lt;p&gt; 12-Aug-2026  TMF770 v5.0.0  RC1 Preview release: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, and Postman Collection. &lt;/p&gt; </td><td>TMF770</td><td>Customer</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v5.0</td><td>2026-09-04</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Resource Usage API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;The Resource Usage Management API provides a standardized mechanism for resource
usage management such as the creation, update, retrieval, import and export of a collection
of usages. A resource usage is an occurrence of employing a Resource, Resource Usage
can influence of Service Usage and/or Product Usage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version history&lt;/b&gt;
