&lt;p&gt;22 Sep 2021&lt;/p&gt; Stable release: OAS, User Guide, Conformance profile, CTK, RI and postman released.</td><td>TMF657</td><td>Service</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v4.0</td><td>2026-05-15</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Resource Qualification API</td><td>The Resource Qualification API efficiently provides and recommends resource instances within networked environments based on client or front-end system inputs.  Its functionality is read-only, meaning it does not configure, update, or modify resource instances. Instead, it focuses on reducing operational inefficiencies by checking or query resource instances.
