&lt;p&gt;22-Nov-2024  v5.1.1 preview release:  Conformance profile and User Guide: minor bug fixes released.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;01-Nov-2024  v5.1.1 preview release:  OAS v5.1.1 The 5.1 brings new requirements from GSMA to allow more use cases regarding legislations constraints including last stable version of W3C DPV values to fulfill GDPR requirements. There are also some improvements on modelling and descriptions. All changes are detailed in "Acknowledgements" chapter of the User Guide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;01-Aug-2024 v5.1.0 preview release: The 5.1 brings new requirements from GSMA to allow more use cases regarding legislations constraints. There are also some improvements on modelling and descriptions. All changes are detailled in "Acknowledgements" chapter of the User Guide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;v5.0.0 
&lt;p&gt;16 Sept 2024 v5.0.0 stable release: fix for Postman Collection has bad indentation.
&lt;p&gt; 21 Feb 2024 v5.0.0 stable release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;This API is an Open Gateway Operate API, produced within the 
