&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;
22-Apr-2026 - Usage Consumption API v5.1.0 Stable release:&lt;/b&gt; Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, Postman Collection, CTK and RI. This API to bring in line with current schemas and facilitate an updated CTK build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;08-Apr-2026 – TMF677 v5.1 Preview release: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide,  Conformance Profile, and Postman Collection&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
Update: Refresh of TMF677 Usage Consumption API to bring in line with current schemas and facilitate an updated CTK build&lt;/p&gt;

