&lt;/style&gt;</td><td>TMF760</td><td>Customer</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v5.0</td><td>2026-05-08</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Digital Identity Management API</td><td>Provides the ability to manage a digital identity. This digital identity allows identification of an individual, a resource, or a partyRole (a specific role - or set of roles - for a given individual). A digital identity is associated with credential / authentication method. These credential / authentication methods should be extensible to describe all types of authentication methods such as login/password, biometric, token, etc. A contact medium is also associated with digital identity (or directly at credential level) to manage credential recovery UCs.
&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version history&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;v5.0.0&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; 18 July 2025 preview release v5.0.0: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile&lt;/p&gt;
