&lt;p&gt;
V4.0 15-May-2026 –  CTK updated
docker-compose has been expanded to enable proxy settings by default, simplifying CTK execution in corporate HTTP proxy environments. README files have been updated to document proxy configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</td><td>TMF706</td><td>Common</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v4.0</td><td>2026-05-15</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Test Result Management API</td><td>This API provides a standardized mechanism for the management of test results. These include Test Case Results, Test Suite Results, and Non-functional Test Results.pro
