docker-compose has been expanded to enable proxy settings by default, simplifying CTK execution in corporate HTTP proxy environments. README files have been updated to document proxy configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</td><td>TMF707</td><td>Common</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v4.0</td><td>2026-05-15</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Open Gateway Product Usage API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;
The TMF937 Open Gateway Product Usage API v5.0.0 defines an asynchronous bulk export mechanism for exchanging aggregated ProductUsage records between Operators and Channel Partners. It standardizes usage collection, reporting, reconciliation, and settlement processes for Open Gateway APIs, supporting both rated and non-rated commercial models. The API aligns with the TMF635 v5.0 information model.
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version history&lt;/b&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;v5.0.00-rc1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
27-February-2026 v5.0.0 Preview release: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, and Postman Collection.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;br&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;This API is an Open Gateway Operate API, produced within the 
  &lt;a href="https://www.gsma.com/solutions-and-impact/gsma-open-gateway/joint-certification-program-gsma-tm-forum/" 
     target="_blank" 
     rel="noopener noreferrer" 
     class="styled-link"&gt;
    GSMA Open Gateway&lt;/a&gt; initiative.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

