&lt;/style&gt;</td><td>TMF937</td><td>Product</td><td>RESTful</td><td>N/A</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Test Scenario Management API</td><td>This API provides a standardized mechanism for the management of test scenarios. Test scenarios provide a full specification of required test elements, e.g. Test Case T parameterized with test data instance D running on abstract test environment E provisioned with a set of provisioning artefacts P.
&lt;p&gt; 30-Aug-2024 v4.0.0 CTK fixes released
