&lt;p&gt;</td><td>TMF728</td><td>Common</td><td>RESTful</td><td>N/A</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>User Role Permission Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;
A user role is defined as the entity that defines a set of privileges covering various functions and/or manageable assets. 
When a user is assigned a given role then it is actually allocated all the privileges defined for that role type and the corresponding permissions are created for that user.
&lt;/p&gt;

