&lt;p&gt; 19 Jan 2026 preview release: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile&lt;/p&gt;</td><td>TMF649</td><td>Common</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v5.0</td><td>2026-05-08</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Service Activation Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;The REST API for Activation and Configuration allows the user to retrieve, create, update, delete services and retrieve the monitor resource used to monitor the execution of asynchronous requests on a specific resource. Although all the examples given in the API specification are relative to Services, the same API can be used to Activate and Configure Services or Resources.&lt;/p&gt;
