date query parameters previously required values to be enclosed in double quotes. This has been corrected — dates are now passed unquoted. docker-compose has been expanded to enable proxy settings by default, simplifying CTK execution in corporate HTTP proxy environments. README files have been updated to document proxy configuration. &lt;/p&gt;
