&lt;p&gt; 4-Sept-2026 TMF689 v5.0.0 RC2 Preview release: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, and Postman Collection. Updated preview including marking @refrredType as required in ResourceRef, relocation of the ServiceProvider schema to align with the engaged party model, addition of TMF669 Party Role API relationship documentation, and updates to sequence diagrams to better describe service provider interactions and API usage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; 20-May-2026 TMF689 preview release v5.0.0: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, Postman Collection.&lt;/p&gt;</td><td>TMF689</td><td>Resource</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v5.0</td><td>2026-10-16</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Shopping Cart Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;A standardized mechanism for the management of shopping carts. Including creation, update, retrieval, deletion and notification of an event. Shopping Cart entity is used for the temporary selection and reservation of product offerings in e-commerce and retail purchase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version history&lt;/b&gt;
