     class="styled-link"&gt;
    here for more information&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;23 Jan 2025 CTK update:  ChangeME.json file for POST method of operation  BillingAccount operation, in partyOrPartyRole changed value of @type field from "PartyRefOrPartyRoleRef" to "PartyRef" &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;19 Sep 2023&lt;/p&gt; Stable release: OAS, User Guide, Conformance profile, CTK, RI and postman released.

