&lt;/style&gt;</td><td>TMF632</td><td>Business Partner</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v5.0</td><td>2026-05-08</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Product Usage Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;
Provides a standardized mechanism for usage management, including the creation, update, retrieval, import, and export of a collection of usages. The API manages both rated and non-rated usage. For example, it allows a service provider to (1) retrieve usage generated by a partner service platform for rating purposes and (2) provide rated usage to a partner for consumption follow-up.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version history&lt;/b&gt;

&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;v5.0.0&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt; 08-May-2026 docker-compose has been expanded to enable proxy settings by default, simplifying CTK execution in corporate HTTP proxy environments where this previously required in‑house configuration. README files have been updated to document proxy usage. Failed HTML reports can now be opened directly in a browser, and HTML reports now include headers identifying the API and CTK version used, improving certification clarity and traceability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
