&lt;/p&gt;</td><td>TMF635</td><td>Product</td><td>RESTful</td><td>v5.0</td><td>2026-05-08</td><td>Production</td></tr><tr><td>Revenue Sharing Report Management API</td><td>&lt;p&gt;Revenue Sharing Report Management API goal is to provide the report of a revenue sharing.&lt;/p&gt;
