&lt;p&gt;v5.0.0&lt;/pr&gt;
&lt;p&gt; 08-May-2026 docker-compose has been expanded to enable proxy settings by default, simplifying CTK execution in corporate HTTP proxy environments where this previously required in‑house configuration. README files have been updated to document proxy usage. Failed HTML reports can now be opened directly in a browser, and HTML reports now include headers identifying the API and CTK version used, improving certification clarity and traceability.&lt;/p&gt;
