&lt;p&gt;4-Sept-2026 TMF664 v5.0.0 RC3 Preview release: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, and Postman Collection. 
&lt;p&gt;
22-July-2026 TMF664 v5.0.0 RC2 Preview release: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, and Postman Collection. Updated preview including improved API and schema descriptions, enhanced Heal, Scale and Migrate documentation, standardised enum values and reusable schema definitions, updated examples and conformance assets, and validation and conformance profile improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
19-June-2026 TMF664 v5.0.0 RC1 Preview release: Open API Specification (OAS), User Guide, Conformance Profile, and Postman Collection.
This release provides the first v5.0.0 preview of the Resource Function Activation Management API, aligned with the latest TM Forum Open API standards.
&lt;/p&gt;

